I was in the beginning of an *unbelievably* good game of NH 3.1.0
when I hit a sleep trap and died an *unbelievably* stupid death,
being wasted by some nearby monsters.  

Incredibly, I started the game on a square which had the Mjollnir!
Then on level 2 I broke into a chest which had a Wand of Wishing!
After wishing for a blessed rustproof +3 Vorpal Blade and blessed
rustproof +3 gauntlets of power, I went on my merry way until that
damn sleep trap on level 5.  AAARGGH!  

Checked the nethackdir and luckily there was a fresh bones file.
Quickly started another game and died too soon.  Checked for the
bones file, it was still there, so I started another game.  Again
a quick death, but this time when I checked the bones were gone!
I did not reach level 5 in that game.  What happened?  Checked
the logfile and no other players were playing, and there were
no other active games going.  

Do bones files randomly disappear so quickly?

